#. 遅くなってごめん…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Sorry I'm late..."
msgstr ""

#. あ、苗木…大丈夫…？
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Hey...are you okay, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. 部屋を確認するだけと言っていた割に遅いから、
#. 今から迎えに行こうと思っていたのだぞ！！
msgctxt "0003 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"You sure took your sweet time! I was just about to go\n"
"get you and drag you back here!"
msgstr ""

#. ご、ごめん……
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#. それで、どうだ？
#. 部屋はちゃんと掃除されていたか？
msgctxt "0005 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"So? What happened? Was your room fixed up like he\n"
"said?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体なんかが放置されている部屋では、
#. 寝られなくて困ってしまうからなッ！
msgctxt "0006 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid ""
"I imagine it would be pretty hard to sleep with a\n"
"rotting corpse in your bathroom!"
msgstr ""

#. オイオイ…
#. オメェ、空気読めなさ過ぎだろ…
msgctxt "0007 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid ""
"Jesus, that's fucked up, man. Why would you say\n"
"something like that?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクの部屋…
#. 何もなかったみたいにキレイになってた…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "My room was...spotless. There wasn't anything left."
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…そこで…
#. <CLT 3>何もなかった<CLT>みたいに…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Like the whole thing...<CLT 3>never happened<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. …殺人が起きた部屋で寝泊まりは辛いだろう。
#. そのまま、舞園の部屋を使ってはどうだ？
msgctxt "0010 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It must be tough staying there, knowing what happened.\n"
"Why don't you just stay in Sayaka's room?"
msgstr ""

#. でも…舞園さんの匂いが残る部屋で寝泊まりする方が、
#. 辛いって言うか…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well...staying there, with her scent still hanging in\n"
"the air... That would hurt just as much."
msgstr ""

#. それに…
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Plus..."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さんの死から…
#. 目を背けちゃいけない気がするんだ…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I've decided that I can't turn away from her death..."
msgstr ""

#. な、苗木……
msgctxt "0014 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "M-Makoto..."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、元気出してよ！
#. しょげ返ってたって仕方がないんだしさ！
msgctxt "0015 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Hey, cheer up! Getting depressed isn't gonna help\n"
"anything, right?"
msgstr ""

#. …とにかく、みんなで協力すれば、
#. ここから出られるはずだって。
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"If we all work together, I'm sure we'll find a way out\n"
"of here!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、さ…
#. みんなで協力して明るく行こうよ、ね！
msgctxt "0017 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"So everyone just...try and cheer up and get back on\n"
"track!"
msgstr ""

#. …気休めにもならない事を言うな。
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Is that honestly supposed to make us feel better?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ…？
msgctxt "0019 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 今だって何度も協力と言いつつ殺人は起きた。
#. 次からは、もっと簡単に裏切る者が出るはずだ…
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We were already \"working together\" and yet someone was\n"
"still murdered. Anyone could betray us at this point."
msgstr ""

#. 今や、殺人は現実離れした出来事ではなく、
#. ごく身近なものだと誰もが知ったのだからな…
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Now that it's happened once, it's a question of when,\n"
"not if, the next one takes place."
msgstr ""

#. 舞園さやかが…<CLT 3>口火を切った<CLT>せいでね……
msgctxt "0022 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Yeah, because S-Sayaka <CLT 3>made the first move<CLT>..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. だ、だけど…これ以上犠牲を増やさない為には、
#. みんなで協力して、黒幕と戦わないと…
msgctxt "0024 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"B-But...if we work together against the mastermind,\n"
"nobody'll have any reason to do something like that!"
msgstr ""

#. だから言ってるだろう？
#. 気休めにもならない事を言うなと…
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Keep telling yourself that. I'll be over here in the\n"
"real world."
msgstr ""

#. 協力するとか戦うとか…
#. これは、そんな次元の話じゃないんだ。
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Working together, fighting a common enemy... Like it\n"
"or not, it's not that simple."
msgstr ""

#. …と、言いますと？
msgctxt "0027 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "...What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕は、当初わたくし達が考えていたのよりも、
#. ずっと強大な力を持ち合わせているようです。
msgctxt "0028 | CELES"
msgid ""
"The mastermind seems to be much more powerful than we\n"
"ever suspected."
msgstr ""

#. 警備が厚いはずの<CLT 3>希望ヶ峰学園を乗っ取り<CLT>、
#. さらには、そこに様々な改良を加え…
msgctxt "0029 | CELES"
msgid ""
"They <CLT 3>took over Hope's Peak<CLT>, which was supposed to be\n"
"well defended, then modified it to fit their desire."
msgstr ""

#. 一応は高度な技術力を有するらしいモノクマを開発し、
#. わたくし達の膨大な生活必需品まで揃えて…
msgctxt "0030 | CELES"
msgid ""
"They created Monokuma, which seems to be incredibly\n"
"advanced, and they're providing for our every need."
msgstr ""

#. 極めつけは、あの<CLT 3>処刑<CLT>…
msgctxt "0031 | CELES"
msgid "And the cherry on top is the <CLT 3>execution<CLT> we witnessed."
msgstr ""

#. すべて…手が込み過ぎています…
msgctxt "0032 | CELES"
msgid ""
"Everything has been planned down to the\n"
"last excruciating detail."
msgstr ""

#. ただの異常者の仕業とは到底思えません。
#. 逆らうには、危険過ぎる相手と言えるでしょう。
msgctxt "0033 | CELES"
msgid ""
"This is not the work of your everyday psychopath.\n"
"Defying them may be too great of a risk..."
msgstr ""

#. ならば、我らはどうするべきだ？
msgctxt "0034 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Then...what are we supposed to do?"
msgstr ""

#. …ここでのルールに従うまでだ。
#. どうしても、ここから出たいのなら…
msgctxt "0035 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Anyone who truly does want to escape...will just have\n"
"to follow the rules."
msgstr ""

#. 他のヤツらを騙して勝つ…
#. それしかないだろう。
msgctxt "0036 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"In which case, the only option is to deceive those\n"
"around you, and win the game."
msgstr ""

#. イヤ…だ……
msgctxt "0037 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "N-No..."
msgstr ""

#. なんだと…？
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "No what?"
msgstr ""

#. 誰かを殺してまで…生きたくない…
msgctxt "0039 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid ""
"I don't want to live...if it means killing someone\n"
"else to do it."
msgstr ""

#. 人を殺すのは…もうイヤだよ……
msgctxt "0040 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "I don't want to kill anyone else...!"
msgstr ""

#. もう…って、どういう意味だべ？
msgctxt "0041 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Anyone...else? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、桑田君は、
#. みんなが投票したせいで死んじゃったんだよ…！
msgctxt "0042 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "Leon died because we all voted for him, right?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>みんなで殺した<CLT>のと…同じだよ…！
msgctxt "0043 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "It's no different from <CLT 3>us killing him ourselves<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. で、でもよ…
msgctxt "0044 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "B-But..."
msgstr ""

#. あの時、桑田に投票してなかったら、
#. 逆に、私らが処刑されてたんだよ？
msgctxt "0045 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"If we hadn't voted for him, then we all woulda died\n"
"instead, right...?"
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲ちゃんは…それでよかったの？
msgctxt "0046 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "That isn't what you wanted, is it...?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0047 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. そうですぞ。それ以上自分を追い込むのは、
#. マゾヒストのする事ですぞ。
msgctxt "0048 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"She's right. If you heap that kind of blame on\n"
"yourself, you'll turn into a full-fledged masochist."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0049 | CHIHIRO FUJISAKI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ねぇ、不二咲さん…
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Chihiro, listen..."
msgstr ""

#. 悪いのは不二咲さんじゃないよ。
#. 桑田クンでも、もちろん舞園さんでもない…
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You're not to blame. Not you, not Leon, and not\n"
"Sayaka."
msgstr ""

#. 全部…黒幕のせいだよ…
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The mastermind is responsible for everything that's\n"
"happened."
msgstr ""

#. ボク達に投票を強制したのも黒幕なんだし、
#. 逆らってたら、どうなったかわからないんだ…
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"We had no choice but to vote. I can't even imagine\n"
"what would've happened to us if we'd refused..."
msgstr ""

#. それに…処刑なんて言ってたけど、
#. 結局、桑田クンを殺したのは黒幕じゃないか！！
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And in the end, it was Monokuma who ultimately killed\n"
"Leon...!"
msgstr ""

#. だから…ボクらが憎むべきは自分達じゃなくて…
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So don't waste your anger on yourself..."
msgstr ""

#. 黒幕のヤツなんだッ！！
msgctxt "0056 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Instead, direct it at the mastermind!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、校内放送でーす。
#. 午後１０時になりました。
msgctxt "0058 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Mm, ahem, this is a school announcement. It is now 10\n"
"p.m."
msgstr ""

#. ただいまより<CLT 3>“夜時間”<CLT>になります。
msgctxt "0059 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "As such, it is officially <CLT 3>nighttime<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 間もなく食堂はドアをロックされますので、
#. 立ち入り禁止となりま～す。
msgctxt "0060 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Soon the doors to the dining hall will be locked, and\n"
"entry at that point is strictly prohibited."
msgstr ""

#. えー、後ですねぇ…
msgctxt "0061 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Oh, and one other thing..."
msgstr ""

#. 先程のオマエラの発言には、自分を正当化しようとする
#. 浅ましさが見え隠れしていました。
msgctxt "0062 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It was totally obvious before that you were trying to\n"
"make yourselves feel better and justify what you did."
msgstr ""

#. 見え見え隠れ見え見え…ぐらいの割合…
#. つまり、ほとんどまる見えな見え隠れでした！
msgctxt "0063 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"See you, see you, don't see you, see you! That's about\n"
"how much I can see you, even when you try to hide!"
msgstr ""

#. いいですか、よく覚えておいてくださいね…
msgctxt "0064 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Now pay attention and remember this well!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>人が人を裁く責任<CLT>は重いんだ！
#. ちゃんと自覚しろよなッ！
msgctxt "0065 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"The <CLT 3>burden of judging others<CLT> is a heavy one to bear.\n"
"So be well aware of your actions!"
msgstr ""

#. 秩序は、犠牲と責任の上にのみ成り立つんだよッ！！
msgctxt "0066 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Order and stability rely on the sacrifice and\n"
"responsibility of everyone!"
msgstr ""

#. ではでは、いい夢を。おやすみなさい…
msgctxt "0067 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay then...sweet dreams, everyone! Good night, sleep\n"
"tight, don't let the bed bugs bite..."
msgstr ""

#. なんなのよ…今の…
msgctxt "0068 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "What w-was that about just n-now...?"
msgstr ""

#. ぜーんぶ、俺らの責任ってか？
#. そいつは…また随分なこったな…
msgctxt "0069 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Was he saying it's our fault what happened? That's\n"
"pretty cruel, man..."
msgstr ""

#. …クソがッ！！　言いてー事だけ言いやがって…！
msgctxt "0070 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "That piece of shit! Who does he think he is!?"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>こうして、激動の１日は終わりを告げた…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And so, the day drew to a close...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さん、江ノ島さん、桑田クン…
#. ３人もの犠牲者を出した激動の１日…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A tense, maddening day that saw the deaths of three\n"
"classmates. Sayaka, Junko, and Leon...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…
#. これは、まだ始まったばかり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...this is just the beginning...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>“ボクらの絶望”<CLT><CLT 4>は…
#. まだ始まったばかりだったんだ…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>Our despair<CLT><CLT 4> has only just begun...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
